# pnpm 11 reads ONLY auth/registry settings from .npmrc. All other pnpm settings
# (nodeOptions, linkWorkspacePackages, preferWorkspacePackages, autoInstallPeers)
# now live in pnpm-workspace.yaml as camelCase keys. Do not re-add them here — they
# would be silently ignored.
#
# Strict layout is intentional: do NOT enable shamefully-hoist or node-linker=hoisted.
# If a package needs a dep it does not declare, declare it — don't hoist around it.
